WEBVTT

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.825
Open Settings, Search, Site Search.

00:00:05.825 --> 00:00:09.402
Default search index lists the indexes you created.

00:00:09.402 --> 00:00:15.113
Select website, which the search page queries unless the address names another index.

00:00:15.609 --> 00:00:19.702
Placeholder is the text that the search box of the search page shows

00:00:19.702 --> 00:00:21.307
before a visitor types.

00:00:21.307 --> 00:00:24.349
Enter Search articles and posts, and select Save.

